Package: sewloreSpecimenTables
Type: Package
Title: Explicitly Paired Fabric Specimen Measurement Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sewlore", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "sewingselami@gmail.com")
Description: Validates long-format paired specimen measurements, normalizes
    millimetres, centimetres and inches, and compares before and after values
    within an explicitly identified cohort, specimen, wash cycle and axis.
    Preserves original values and units and reports incomplete pairs without
    estimating missing observations. Provides descriptive cohort tables and
    spreadsheet-conscious CSV export. Example data are entirely synthetic
    and are not empirical research or fabric performance claims.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: utils, stats
Suggests: knitr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://sewlore.com/pages/fabric-measurement-methods-guide, https://sewlore.com/
NeedsCompilation: no
